{"verse":15,"translation":"That search be made in the book of the records of your fathers, and you shall find in the book of the records and know, that this city is a rebellious city, and damaging to kings and provinces, and that sedition they have made within it from days of old — on account of this this city was destroyed.","tokens":[{"surface":"די","gloss":"That"},{"surface":"יבקר","gloss":"search be made"},{"surface":"בספר","gloss":"in the book"},{"surface":"דכרניא","gloss":"of the records","readings":["of the records","of the memorials"],"held_by":{"of the records":["v1","v2","v3","en4"],"of the memorials":["en4"]}},{"surface":"די","gloss":"of"},{"surface":"אבהתך","gloss":"your fathers"},{"surface":"ותהשכח","gloss":"and you shall find"},{"surface":"בספר","gloss":"in the book"},{"surface":"דכרניא","gloss":"of the records"},{"surface":"ותנדע","gloss":"and know"},{"surface":"די","gloss":"that"},{"surface":"קריתא","gloss":"the city"},{"surface":"דך","gloss":"this"},{"surface":"קריא","gloss":"is a city"},{"surface":"מרדא","gloss":"rebellious"},{"surface":"ומהנזקת","gloss":"and damaging"},{"surface":"מלכין","gloss":"to kings"},{"surface":"ומדנן","gloss":"and provinces"},{"surface":"ואשתדור","gloss":"and sedition"},{"surface":"עבדין","gloss":"they have made"},{"surface":"בגוה","gloss":"within it","readings":["within it","in its midst"],"held_by":{"within it":["v1","en4"],"in its midst":["v2","v3"]}},{"surface":"מן","gloss":"from"},{"surface":"יומת","gloss":"days"},{"surface":"עלמא","gloss":"of old"},{"surface":"על","gloss":"on account of"},{"surface":"דנה","gloss":"this"},{"surface":"קריתא","gloss":"the city"},{"surface":"דך","gloss":"this"},{"surface":"החרבת","gloss":"was destroyed"}],"pass":"en5","judge":"glm-5.3"}